          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Leovoamu aenda Sekemu; nũndũ Isilaeli onthe maĩ aendu Sekemu makamũtw’ĩkĩthye mũsumbĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.12.1+1KI.12.2+1KI.12.3+1KI.12.4+1KI.12.5+1KI.12.6+1KI.12.7+1KI.12.8+1KI.12.9+1KI.12.10+1KI.12.11+1KI.12.12+1KI.12.13+1KI.12.14+1KI.12.15+1KI.12.16+1KI.12.17+1KI.12.18+1KI.12.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Asu 12.1–19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kweethĩwa, yĩla Yelovoamu mwana wa Nevati wewie ũu (nũndũ aĩ Misili, vala wakĩĩĩe aume vala ve mũsumbĩ Solomoni), Yelovoamu asyoka kuma Misili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.11.40"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Asu 11.40",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na matũmana aketwe; na Yelovoamu na Isilaeli onthe mooka, na maneena na Leovoamu, makĩmwĩa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ĩthe waku nĩwatw’ĩkĩthĩtye ĩsoki yitũ ĩito: yu kwondũ wa ũu vũthangya ũthũkũmi ũsu mũito wa ĩthe waku, na ĩsoki yake ĩito yĩla watwĩkĩie, na tũkakũthũkũma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.5.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Asu 5.15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na amea Mwĩmbũkĩa ĩngĩ ĩtina wa mĩthenya ĩtatũ. Na andũ asu mathi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mũsumbĩ Leovoamu eethĩwa nzama na atumĩa, ala maũngamaa mbee wa ĩthe wake Solomoni yĩla ũnaĩ o thayũ, akĩmakũlya, Mwĩnenga ũtao wĩva nĩmasũngĩa andũ asu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na maneena nake, makĩmwĩa, Ethĩwa ũkeethĩwa mũseo kwa andũ asu, na kũmendeesya, na kũmaneen’ya ndeto nzeo, mo makeethĩwa athũkũmi maku tene na tene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ĩndĩ atia ũtao wa atumĩa ũla mamũtaie naw’o, na eethĩwa nzama na anake ala ma mũika wake ala maũngamaa mbee wake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na amakũlya, Mwĩnenga ũtao wĩva, nĩ kana twĩmasũngĩa andũ asu, ala maneenete nakwa, makĩmbĩa, Tũvũthangĩsye ĩsoki yĩla ĩthe waku watwĩkĩie? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na anake ala ma mũika wake maneena nake, makĩmwĩa, Ũũ nĩw’o wĩmatavya andũ asu ala maneenie naku, makĩkwĩa, Ĩthe waku nĩwatw’ĩkĩthisye ĩsoki yitũ ĩito, ĩndĩ we tũvũthangĩsye; ũũ nĩw’o wĩmatavya, Kyaa kyakwa kya mwela nĩ kĩnene kwĩ kĩnyunyu kya ĩthe wakwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na yu o ũndũ ĩthe wakwa wamwaĩkĩtye ĩsoki ĩito, nakwa ngongeleela ĩsoki yenyu: ĩthe wakwa amũsilĩlaa na mĩsalisa, ĩndĩ nyĩe ngamũsilĩlaa na ing’auũ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ĩndĩ Yelovoamu, na andũ onthe mooka vala ve Leovoamu mũthenya wa katatũ, o tondũ mũsumbĩ weaĩte akĩmea, Mbũkĩai ĩngĩ mũthenya wa katatũ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mũsumbĩ amasũngĩa na vinya; na mũsumbĩ Leovoamu atia ũtao wa atumĩa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na aneena nao kwĩanana na ũtao wa anake, akĩmea, Ĩthe wakwa nĩwatw’ĩkĩthĩtye ĩsoki yenyu ĩito, ĩndĩ nyie ngayongeleela: ĩthe wakwa amũsilĩlaa na mĩsalisa, ĩndĩ nyie ngamũsilĩlaa na ing’auũ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ĩndĩ mũsumbĩ ndaaĩthukĩĩsya andũ; nũndũ ũu waĩ ũndũ waetetwe nĩ Ngai, nĩ kana Yeova alũlũmĩlye ndeto yake, ĩla wamũtavisye Yelovoamu mwana wa Nevati na kanyw’a wa Aiya Mũsilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.11.29+1KI.11.30+1KI.11.31+1KI.11.32+1KI.11.33+1KI.11.34+1KI.11.35+1KI.11.36+1KI.11.37+1KI.11.38+1KI.11.39"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Asu 11.29–39",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na yĩla Isilaeli onthe moonie kana mũsumbĩ ndaamethukĩĩsya, andũ mamũsũngĩa mũsumbĩ, makĩmwĩa, Twĩ na kĩanda kyaũ nthĩnĩ wa Ndaviti? O na tũti na ũtiĩwa nthĩnĩ wa mwana wa Yese: inyw’ĩ Isilaeli, kĩla mũndũ, endai maeemanĩ menyu: na yu ĩsyaĩĩsye nyũmba yaku mwene, Ndaviti. Na ĩndĩ Isilaeli onthe maenda maeemanĩ moo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ĩndĩ ũndũ wa ana ma Isilaeli ala matwĩe ndũanĩ sya Yuta, Leovoamu amasumbĩka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ĩndĩ mũsumbĩ Leovoamu atũma Aatolamu, ũla waĩ mũnene wa andũ ala matethethaw’a wĩa na vinya; na ana ma Isilaeli mamũkimanga na mavia akw’a. Na mũsumbĩ Leovoamu eekalaata ambate vala ve ĩkasya yake, akĩe avike Yelusaleme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ũu nĩw’o Isilaeli mang’endeie nyũmba ya Ndaviti kũvika ũmũnthĩ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
